---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../utils/categories';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Nestlyra — how we handle information on nestlyraliving.com."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="container-editorial max-w-3xl py-10 sm:py-14 md:py-20">
    <p class="section-label">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl text-ink sm:mt-3 sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">Last updated: August 11, 2026</p>
    <div class="prose-editorial mt-8">
      <p>
        {SITE_NAME} (“we”, “us”) operates nestlyraliving.com. This policy explains what information
        may be collected when you visit the site and how it is used.
      </p>
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        Like most static websites, we may receive standard server or CDN logs such as IP address,
        browser type, and pages requested. If you join our newsletter (when signup is enabled), we
        collect the email address you submit through our newsletter provider.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We may load Google Analytics 4 when a measurement ID is configured for the deployed site. If
        analytics is not configured, we do not load analytics scripts. Affiliate partners such as
        Amazon may set cookies when you follow outbound product links. Review their policies for
        details.
      </p>
      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To operate and improve the website</li>
        <li>To send newsletters you opt into (when available)</li>
        <li>To understand aggregate traffic patterns when analytics is enabled</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        Hosting, newsletter, analytics, and affiliate partners process data under their own terms. We
        do not sell personal information.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about privacy: <a href="mailto:hello@nestlyraliving.com">hello@nestlyraliving.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
